<title>USA: Possis Medical submits FDA supplement.</title>
<headline>Possis Medical submits FDA supplement.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Possis Medical Inc said Thursday it has submitted a supplemental application to the U.S. Food and Drug Administration for clearance to sell its AngioJet Rapid Thrombectomy System.</p>
<p>The device, used to clean out clogged blood vessels, is undergoing clinical trials in the United States.</p>
<p>The supplemental application responds to the FDA's questions on the original application submitted in March.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
